{
  "slug": "ugc-website-video",
  "name": "UGC Video From Your Site",
  "description": "A creator talks to camera about your product while your site's screenshots pop up as cards, with captions. Upload 3 to 8 screenshots, pick the length and the creator, and run.",
  "markdownDescription": "## UGC Video From Your Site\n\nA creator talks to camera about your product while your screenshots pop up as cards, with captions. This template already holds one finished example run, so you can see what every step makes before you spend anything. Replace the example inputs on the left with yours and press Run: everything is made new for your product.\n\n1. Your product — the name and the screenshots the video is about.\n2. Script and creator — the spoken script, and who says it.\n3. Clips — each take filmed with the creator speaking.\n4. The finished video — joined, with the screenshot cards and captions.\n\nFrom about 2,900 credits for a 15-second video; longer videos cost more. While the video renders, about twice the clip's price is held and what is not used is returned.",
  "category": "video-ads",
  "outputTypes": [
    "video"
  ],
  "tags": [
    "ugc",
    "marketing",
    "talking head",
    "captions"
  ],
